repository-code: "https://github.com/Jaingarveet/Agentic_Research_Team"

license: Apache-2.0

abstract: >
  A hierarchical, multi-agent research pipeline built with LangGraph
  that dynamically provisions parallel AI analysts, performs
  simulated expert interviews, compiles technical reports, validates
  LaTeX through a self-healing compilation loop, and deterministically
  commits the final paper to Overleaf.

keywords:
  - LangGraph
  - Multi-Agent Systems
  - LLM
  - AI Platform Engineering
  - Agentic AI
  - Workflow Orchestration
  - Research Automation
  - LaTeX
  - Overleaf
  - State Machines

url: "https://github.com/Jaingarveet/Agentic_Research_Team"
